      "sid": 114,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "就一定能取得胜利",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 279.75,
      "to": 282.85,
      "sid": 115,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "然而很多玩家都不能够重视到这一点",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 282.85,
      "to": 284.69,
      "sid": 116,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "当你学会利用打法",
